{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.850000381469727,"text":"A wreath of thin gold with small leaves and flowers made to look like a branch just cut from a tree. The leaves are so fine that they tremble at the slightest movement. Wreaths like this were worn at feasts and went into the grave with the dead as a mark of honor. Gold never rusts, so what somebody saw in 330 BC is exactly what you are seeing with no difference at all.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.9200000166893005},{"word":"wreath","start":0.9200000166893005,"end":0.9200000166893005},{"word":"of","start":0.9200000166893005,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"thin","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"gold","start":1.559999942779541,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"with","start":1.8799999952316284,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"small","start":2.240000009536743,"end":2.6600000858306885},{"word":"leaves","start":2.6600000858306885,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"and","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.819999933242798},{"word":"flowers","start":3.819999933242798,"end":3.819999933242798},{"word":"made","start":3.819999933242798,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"to","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"look","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"like","start":4.760000228881836,"end":4.960000038146973},{"word":"a","start":4.960000038146973,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"branch","start":5.440000057220459,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"just","start":5.440000057220459,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"cut","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"from","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"a","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"tree","start":6.599999904632568,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"The","start":7.340000152587891,"end":7.559999942779541},{"word":"leaves","start":7.559999942779541,"end":7.78000020980835},{"word":"are","start":7.78000